    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Every wise woman builds her house,",
          "but a foolish one tears it down with her own hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever lives with integrity fears the Lord,",
          "but the one who is devious in his ways despises him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The proud speech of a fool brings a rod of discipline,",
          "but the lips of the wise protect them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Where there are no oxen, the feeding trough is empty,",
          "but an abundant harvest comes through the strength of an ox."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "An honest witness does not deceive,",
          "but a dishonest witness utters lies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A mocker seeks wisdom and doesn’t find it,",
          "but knowledge comes easily to the perceptive."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Stay away from a foolish person;",
          "you will gain no knowledge from his speech."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sensible person’s wisdom is to consider his way,",
          "but the stupidity of fools deceives them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fools mock at making reparation,",
          "but there is goodwill among the upright."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The heart knows its own bitterness,",
          "and no outsider shares in its joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The house of the wicked will be destroyed,",
          "but the tent of the upright will flourish."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There is a way that seems right to a person,",
          "but its end is the way to death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Even in laughter a heart may be sad,",
          "and joy may end in grief."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The disloyal one will get what his conduct deserves,",
          "and a good one, what his deeds deserve."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The inexperienced one believes anything,",
          "but the sensible one watches his steps."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A wise person is cautious and turns from evil,",
          "but a fool is easily angered and is careless."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A quick-tempered person acts foolishly,",
          "and one who schemes is hated."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The inexperienced inherit foolishness,",
          "but the sensible are crowned with knowledge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The evil bow before those who are good,",
          "and the wicked, at the gates of the righteous."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A poor person is hated even by his neighbor,",
          "but there are many who love the rich."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who despises his neighbor sins,",
          "but whoever shows kindness to the poor will be happy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t those who plan evil go astray?",
          "But those who plan good find loyalty and faithfulness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There is profit in all hard work,",
          "but endless talk leads only to poverty."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The crown of the wise is their wealth,",
          "but the foolishness of fools produces foolishness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A truthful witness rescues lives,",
          "but one who utters lies is deceitful."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In the fear of the Lord one has strong confidence",
          "and his children have a refuge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The fear of the Lord is a fountain of life,",
          "turning people away from the snares of death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A large population is a king’s splendor,",
          "but a shortage of people is a ruler’s devastation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A patient person shows great understanding,",
          "but a quick-tempered one promotes foolishness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A tranquil heart is life to the body,",
          "but jealousy is rottenness to the bones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who oppresses the poor person insults his Maker,",
          "but one who is kind to the needy honors him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked one is thrown down by his own sin,",
          "but the righteous one has a refuge in his death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom resides in the heart of the discerning;",
          "she is known even among fools."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Righteousness exalts a nation,",
          "but sin is a disgrace to any people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A king favors a prudent servant,",
          "but his anger falls on a disgraceful one."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
